# Vendored by HelloHowAreYouHaveANiceDay/standards (profile c-base). Do not edit.
# Google style: the same 2-space indent as the base .editorconfig, one documented upstream
# (https://google.github.io/styleguide/cppguide.html#Formatting), covers C and C++ alike.
# Overrides: a nested .clang-format with `BasedOnStyle: InheritParentConfig` and a reason comment per key.
# Vendored / third-party code: list it in the follower-owned .clang-format-ignore (gitignore syntax), with a reason.
BasedOnStyle: Google
LineEnding: LF
InsertNewlineAtEOF: true
